++From 58ac711f9afd0a14fb72fe1c95fe2cecb7084915 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
++From: max994-dev <bmax994@outlook.com>
++Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 19:14:20 +0000
++Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Shared scan runner; profile URL in CCPA emails; more
++ user_age adopters
++MIME-Version: 1.0
++Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
++Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
++
++- sites_scan/_template.py: add run_scan(), wait_cloudflare() and
++  highlight_and_shoot(), and move the five live scan modules onto them
++  (addressescom, advancedbackgroundcheckscom, allpeoplecom,
++  fastpeoplesearchcom, spokeocom). Each module had its own ChromiumPage and
++  quit() only on the happy paths, leaking Chrome on every exception; and
++  each swallowed every exception into "Not Found" — so a Cloudflare block or
++  a timeout was reported to the customer as "you are not on this site".
++  run_scan guarantees quit() in a finally and lets exceptions propagate,
++  where manage.py records them as step=3 "broker_raised" rather than
++  "not_found". It also maps a None/"" return to "Not Found": allpeople could
++  fall off the end and return None, which the dispatcher counts as FOUND — a
++  hit with no screenshot.
++
++- __removal.py, lib/broker_helpers.py: carry the listing URL the scan
++  recorded into data_row as "Profile URL", and include it in the CCPA
++  email when it is a real link. Email-path brokers ask for it
++  (information.com, 2026-09-18) and it makes the request specific.
++
++- sites/ (11 scripts): compute age through user_age() instead of
++  current_year - dataRow["Birth Year"] on a string.
++
++- sites/advancedpeoplesearchcom.py, sites/peoplesearchpro.py: raise a clear
++  "form inputs not found" error instead of IndexError when the page does not
++  render the opt-out form.
++
++Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
