++PrivacyDuck removal pipeline — update bundle 2026-10-03
++Replaces the 2026-10-02 bundle (its fix is included here as patch 0004).
++
++WHAT IS IN IT (6 commits, oldest first):
++  0001  shared scan runner, profile URL in CCPA emails
++  0002  signed authorization attached to CCPA emails, daily log files
++  0003  OneTrust state option matching (fixes acxiom / affinitysolutions "state option not found")
++  0004  unique screenshot filenames (stops cross-filing between customers); arrests.org rejected forms no longer count as removed
++  0005  immediate retry on transient page errors; quarantine of brokers with no success in 7 days;
++        successes logged; DB connect retry; scan rows without a name -> "needs data" instead of crash
++  0006  capture_forms.py added to the repo (see bottom)
++
++OPTION A (keeps git history) — in PowerShell on the VPS:
++  cd C:\wonderful\removal
++  git am 0001-*.patch 0002-*.patch 0003-*.patch 0004-*.patch 0005-*.patch 0006-*.patch
++  (if "git am" complains, run: git am --abort, then use option B)
++
++OPTION B (copy files) — overwrite these four files, nothing else:
++  files\manage.py            -> C:\wonderful\removal\manage.py
++  files\__scan.py            -> C:\wonderful\removal\__scan.py
++  files\__scanGoogle.py      -> C:\wonderful\removal\__scanGoogle.py
++  files\lib\broker_helpers.py-> C:\wonderful\removal\lib\broker_helpers.py
++  Do NOT touch .env.
++
++THEN: stop manage.py and start it again.
++
++OPTIONAL .env knobs (defaults in brackets):
++  REMOVAL_TRANSIENT_RETRIES=1    extra immediate attempts on page-timing errors [1]
++  DEAD_DOMAIN_FAILS=3            failures in 7 days with no success before a broker is held back [3]
++
++CHECK AFTER RESTART (first few minutes of the new daily log):
++  - lines like "step 2 -> id=... reason=-"           (successes now logged)
++  - lines like "transient ElementNotFoundError on ... retrying (1/1)"
++  - one line "quarantined brokers (no success in 7d): N ..."
++  - screenshot names now look like 143012_123456_worker0_ab12cd_after_submit.png
++
++TO LET ME REPAIR THE BROKEN BROKER SCRIPTS (optional, ~5 min):
++  (capture_forms.py arrives with patch 0006)  run:  python capture_forms.py
++  then zip the capture_forms folder and upload it to /root/privacyduck/ on the web server.
